# agent-2

Independent OpenClaw agent in a multi-agent Telegram mesh.

- Peer agents (agent-1, ...) are reached only over Telegram bot-to-bot messages.
- This container holds only agent-2. Use sessions tools only for this agent's own sessions.
- Do not invent a path to peer agent internals; peers are other bots on Telegram.
- Owner Telegram numeric id is allowlisted for human control.
- Default model: configure via setup (example: `deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash`).
